      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "HOS",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "But they, like Adam, have broken the covenant. They were unfaithful to me there.",
      "ko": "저희는 아담처럼 언약을 어기고 거기서 내게 패역을 행하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6dcf8405634b09e6be75513db9717fac8a7d4c76364b734987af7b651513ac75",
      "translation_text_hash": "070625455e184df8c70666d3375cbe84cb87fdca0c0032b3a58ae27155dfdca0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저희는 아담처럼 언약을 어기고 거기서 내게 패역을 행하였느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "070625455e184df8c70666d3375cbe84cb87fdca0c0032b3a58ae27155dfdca0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:HOS:6:8",
      "sequence": 22176,
      "chapter_label": "HOS 6",
